  "galapagos-6days_day_2_title": {
    "en": "Day 2: Santa Cruz – Isabela Island – Flamingo Lagoon – Tortoise Breeding Center – Tintoreras Islet",
    "es": "Día 2: Santa Cruz – Isla Isabela – Laguna De Flamingos – Centro De Crianza – Islote Tintoreras",
    "fr": "Jour 2 : Santa Cruz – Île Isabela – Lagune des Flamants – Centre d'Élevage – Îlot Tintoreras",
    "de": "Tag 2: Santa Cruz – Insel Isabela – Flamingo-Lagune – Schildkrötenzucht – Tintoreras",
    "it": "Giorno 2: Santa Cruz – Isola Isabela – Laguna Fenicotteri – Centro Riproduzione – Tintoreras",
    "pt": "Dia 2: Santa Cruz – Ilha Isabela – Lagoa de Flamingos – Centro de Reprodução – Tintoreras",
    "ja": "第2日: サンタクルス – イサベラ島 – フラミンゴラグーン – ゾウガメ繁殖センター – ティントレラス小島",
    "zh": "第2天：圣克鲁斯 – 伊莎贝拉岛 – 火烈鸟湿地 – 巨龟保护中心 – 蒂恩托雷拉斯石礁"
  },
  "galapagos-6days_day_2_desc": {
    "en": "Morning navigation by speedboat to Isabela Island. In Puerto Villamil, visit the Flamingo Lagoon to spot coastal birds feeding in salt marshes.\n\nTour the Arnaldo Tupiza Breeding Center to witness vulnerable hatchlings and adult tortoises under specialized preservation.\n\nIn the afternoon, board a panga boat to Tintoreras Islet, where white-tip reef sharks rest in tranquil volcanic crevices. Snorkel among Galápagos sea lions, sea turtles, rays, and marine iguanas.\n\nOvernight in Puerto Villamil.",
    "es": "Lancha rápida a Isla Isabela. En Puerto Villamil visitamos la Laguna de Flamingos y el Centro de Crianza Arnaldo Tupiza.\n\nPor la tarde, navegación al Islote Tintoreras con avistamiento de tiburones tintoreras y snorkel con lobos marinos, tortugas, pingüinos y rayas.\n\nNoche en Puerto Villamil.",
    "fr": "Navigation matinale vers Isabela. Découverte de la lagune aux flamants roses et du centre d'élevage Arnaldo Tupiza.\n\nL'après-midi, excursion marine à l'îlot Tintoreras avec observation des requins de récif et plongée avec otaries, tortues et manchots.\n\nNuit à Puerto Villamil.",
    "de": "Schnellbootfahrt nach Isabela. Besuch der Flamingo-Lagune und des Zuchtzentrums Arnaldo Tupiza.\n\nNachmittags Bootstour nach Tintoreras mit Haien in Felsspalten und Schnorcheln mit Pinguinen, Seelöwen und Meeresschildkröten.\n\nÜbernachtung in Puerto Villamil.",
    "it": "Navigazione verso Isabela. Visita della laguna dei fenicotteri e del centro di riproduzione Arnaldo Tupiza.\n\nNel pomeriggio barca verso Tintoreras per ammirare gli squali pinna bianca e fare snorkeling con leoni marini, tartarughe e pinguini.\n\nPernottamento a Puerto Villamil.",
    "pt": "Travessia de lancha até Isabela. Visita à Lagoa de Flamingos e ao Centro de Criação Arnaldo Tupiza.\n\nÀ tarde, passeio de barco a Tintoreras com avistamento de tubarões e snorkeling incrível com leões-marinhos e pinguins.\n\nHospedagem em Puerto Villamil.",
    "ja": "スピードボートでイサベラ島へ。フラミンゴラグーンとアルナルド・ツピサ繁殖センターを見学。\n\n午後はティントレラス岩礁へボートで向かい、浅瀬で休むネムリブカを観察。ウミガメやアシカとシュノーケリング。\n\nプエルトビジャミルにて宿泊。",
    "zh": "快艇前往伊莎贝拉岛，探访火烈鸟湿地及阿纳尔多·图皮萨巨龟繁育中心。\n\n午后换乘小艇前往蒂恩托雷拉斯石礁，观赏栖息在熔岩裂缝中的白鳍礁鲨，与海狮、企鹅和海龟共潜。\n\n夜宿伊莎贝拉岛维利亚米尔港。"
  },
