  "galapagos-6days_day_4_title": {
    "en": "Day 4: Full-Day Excursion – Santa Fe Island Or Pinzón Islet",
    "es": "Día 4: Excursión Full-Day – Isla Santa Fe O Islote Pinzón",
    "fr": "Jour 4 : Excursion Journée Complète – Île Santa Fe ou Pinzón",
    "de": "Tag 4: Ganztagesausflug – Insel Santa Fe oder Pinzón",
    "it": "Giorno 4: Escursione Giornata Intera – Isola Santa Fe o Pinzón",
    "pt": "Dia 4: Excursão Dia Inteiro – Ilha Santa Fe ou Pinzón",
    "ja": "第4日: 終日クルーズ – サンタフェ島またはピンソン島",
    "zh": "第4天：全天游艇巡航 – 圣菲岛或平松岛深潜"
  },
  "galapagos-6days_day_4_desc": {
    "en": "Embark on an expedition yacht toward Santa Fe or Pinzón Island. Marvel at giant prickly pear cactus forests and spot the endemic Barrington land iguana on Santa Fe, or explore Pinzón's nutrient-dense waters.\n\nTwo guided snorkeling sessions offer thrilling close-up encounters with playful sea lions, sea turtles, spotted eagle rays, reef sharks, and schools of vibrant tropical fish.\n\nFresh lunch prepared on board by the ship's chef; return to Puerto Ayora in the late afternoon.",
    "es": "Navegación en yate hacia Santa Fe o Pinzón. Observación de iguanas terrestres endémicas en Santa Fe o aguas profundas en Pinzón.\n\nDos sesiones de snorkel guiado con lobos marinos, tortugas marinas, rayas águila y peces multicolores.\n\nAlmuerzo a bordo y retorno a Puerto Ayora.",
    "fr": "Journée de navigation en yacht vers Santa Fe ou Pinzón. Observation de la faune endémique et deux sessions de snorkeling avec otaries, tortues et raies.\n\nDéjeuner frais à bord et retour en fin d'après-midi.",
    "de": "Yachttour zur Insel Santa Fe oder Pinzón mit zwei geführten Schnorchelgängen mit Seelöwen, Schildkröten und Rochen.\n\nFrisches Mittagessen an Bord und Rückkehr am späten Nachmittag.",
    "it": "Navigazione verso Santa Fe o Pinzón. Due sessioni di snorkeling guidato tra leoni marini, tartarughe e mante.\n\nPranzo servito a bordo e rientro nel tardo pomeriggio.",
    "pt": "Passeio de iate até Santa Fe ou Pinzón com duas sessões de snorkeling entre tartarugas, arraias e leões-marinhos.\n\nAlmoço a bordo e retorno ao final da tarde.",
    "ja": "専用ヨットでサンタフェ島またはピンソン島へ。2回のシュノーケリングでウミガメやエイ、アシカと遊泳。\n\n船上で出来立ての昼食を味わい、夕方帰港。",
    "zh": "搭乘探险游艇前往圣菲岛或平松岛。开展两次专业向导陪同下的深水浮潜，与海狮幼崽、海龟群、鹰鳐及珊瑚鱼群亲密互动。\n\n游艇上享用主厨精美午餐，傍晚返回阿约拉港。"
  },
